d` stubs, tests arrive in Phase 2\n- [x] Verified manually against the real Sheet (`clasp push` + Repo Pulse > Sync now)\n  - Menu appears; OAuth consent completed\n  - Missing Settings tab → clear fail-fast error (`Missing \"Settings\" tab…`)\n  - With Settings `Joel-Fah | repo-to-sheets | TRUE`: \"Sync complete.\", Log row with `reposSynced = 1`\n  - Recurring trigger: Log rows at 23:35:23 and 23:45:23 (WAT) are exactly 10:00 apart with no manual click; latest has `reposSynced = 1`\n\n## Docs\n- [ ] `docs/features/*.md` added, or\n- [x] `docs/decisions/*.md` added, or — ADR 0001 (Apps Script over Node + Actions)\n- [ ] N/A — no doc-worthy change\n\n## README\n- [x] Updated if user-facing behavior changed, or\n- [ ] N/A\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","closed_by":{"login":"Joel-Fah","id":69576717,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTc2NzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69576717?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah","html_url":"https://github.com/Joel-Fah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joel-Fah/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joel-Fah/repo-to-sheets/issues/2/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Joel-Fah/repo-to-shee